OL,3,GNEWSAApproval sought for second phase
OL,4,Aof trail upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FApproval for the second phase of work
OL,7,Fto improve a former railway line used
OL,8,Fby walkers, cyclists and horse riders
OL,9,Fis due to be decided.
OL,11,FHampshire County Council will consider
OL,12,Fplans this month for the next phase of
OL,13,Fwork on the Hayling Billy Trail in
OL,14,FHavant.
OL,16,FThe proposal would improve the southern
OL,17,Fsection of the route with a wider
OL,18,Fall-weather surface and better access
OL,19,Ffor different users.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
