OL,3,GNEWSAApproval sought for second phase
OL,4,Aof trail upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would follow a similar design to the
OL,7,Fnorthern section of the trail, which
OL,8,Fwas upgraded in 2025 to improve
OL,9,Faccessibility and help protect the
OL,10,Froute from erosion.
